<template><MarketplaceLayout><Head title="Marketplace terms | Clipperdesk" /><main class="mp-container mp-narrow"><p class="mp-eyebrow">CLIPPERDESK MARKETPLACE</p><h1 class="mp-title">Before your next visit.</h1><p class="mp-muted">Customer marketplace terms · Version 2026-11-08</p><section class="mp-card"><h2>Booking with a salon</h2><p class="mp-lead">Clipperdesk helps you discover and book independent businesses. The salon provides your services and sets its prices, availability and cancellation rules. Review those details before confirming.</p><h2 style="margin-top:30px">Payments and changes</h2><p class="mp-muted">You pay the salon directly using the payment methods it accepts. Clipperdesk Marketplace does not collect booking payments. The salon handles payment questions and refunds. Rescheduling and cancellation depend on the policy shown with your booking.</p><h2 style="margin-top:30px">Your account and messages</h2><p class="mp-muted">Keep your email sign-in and appointment links private. Only add bookings that belong to you. Keep messages relevant to the booking; harassment, spam and sharing someone else’s private information are not allowed. You can pause a conversation and report a concern from the booking’s messages page.</p><h2 style="margin-top:30px">Reviews and privacy</h2><p class="mp-muted">Reviews are linked to completed visits. Public display requires your separate consent; a customer account or a booking does not grant marketing permission. Your private salon records are not shared with other businesses. Read our <a href="/privacy-policy" style="text-decoration:underline">Privacy notice</a> for information about personal data and support.</p><div class="mp-actions"><Link href="/marketplace/sign-in" class="mp-button">Back to sign in</Link><a href="/help" class="mp-button secondary">Help & support</a></div></section></main></MarketplaceLayout></template>
